    <briefdescription>
<para>Gauss-Chebyshev integration (second kind) </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class performs a 1-dimensional Gauss-Chebyshev integration. <formula id="196">\[ \int_{-1}^{1} f(x) \mathrm{d}x \]</formula> The weighting function is <formula id="201">\[ w(x)=(1-x^2)^{1/2} \]</formula> </para>    </detaileddescription>
